    <string name="faq_q1">Why can\'t I connect with a login button?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Each platform requires app review before apps can sign people in and post for them. Until that is done, accounts are connected with a token you create yourself.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">Why was my post late?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Android may delay background work when battery saver is on. Turn off battery optimisation for AutoPoster for better timing.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">Can I choose a trending sound?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Platform APIs do not let apps pick catalogue music. The sound credit you enter is added to the caption as text.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">What happens if an upload fails?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">AutoPoster retries up to three times with a delay. If it still fails, the post shows in Queue under Problems and you can retry it.</string>
